-10T00:09:48Z","body":"I don't think the full output is needed here.\r\n```\r\n   {\r\n    \"domain\": \"global\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"forbidden\",\r\n    \"message\": \"some-gcloud-bucket@some-gcloud-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com does not have storage.buckets.get access to bucket some-gcloud-bucket.\"\r\n   }\r\n```\r\nIt appears that this is a permissions limitation with the service account I have configured rclone to use. I've run into things like this before when using WAL-e for backups. If you would still like the full output I can email it to you directly.  I will adjust the permissions the service account has, retest and post my results here tomorrow.\r\n\r\nAlso, I think outputting the HTTP response error message when using -v might be a worthwhile addition in the future.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/321414793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"alievrouw","id":3494808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTQ4MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3494808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw","html_url":"https://github.com/alievrouw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/321416105","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/1590#issuecomment-321416105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/1590","id":321416105,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMyMTQxNjEwNQ==","user":{"login":"alievrouw","id":3494808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTQ4MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3494808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw","html_url":"https://github.com/alievrouw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alievrouw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-08-10T00:19:58Z","updated_at":"2017-08-10T00:19:58Z","body":"I did some quick testing. I had to give the service account both \"Storage Legacy Bucket Reader\" and \"Storage Legacy Bucket Writer\" permissions. I had previously given it \"Storage Object Creator\" and \"Storage Object Viewer\". These permissions were causing the errors we were seeing. After finding that it the service account didn't have \"storage.buckets.get\" access I added swapped those two for \"Storage Object Admin\" which still caused the same error. At that point I added the two legacy permissions and was able to run the command successfully. We can discuss more tomorrow. Thanks for the help!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"